["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"aep","stream_identity":"01a0cae6-7e88-710c-8913-d70d29cb7b4c","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG84c07c69d53ebc57a436e3a7632fa3a43f53088e12d3fe1233fc9ef39087aa19","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/review-outcome-field","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: A review-result records what happened to it: no-op, fixed or escalated\n\n## Outcome\n\nEvery critic verdict and every adversary finding ends with a recorded outcome, so a later question — did this lens ever change anything — has data behind it.\n\n## Context\n\nA `review-result` is immutable, so the outcome is a separate record that references it. The wave skill and the critic step (in `agentplugins`) write it when they act on a review: `no-op` when nothing changed, `fixed` when the implementor addressed it, `escalated` when it went to the operator.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- `aep artifact evidence <reviewed-id> --kind review_outcome --review <review-result-id> --outcome no-op|fixed|escalated [--ref …]` records it; the kind is added to the closed evidence-kind list and its help text.\n- A `review_outcome` naming a `review-result` that does not review the artifact is refused.\n- `aep artifact show <review-result-id>` prints its outcomes.\n- `validate` reports (without failing) a `review-result` older than N days with no outcome, N configurable, default 14.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nInferring the outcome from a diff.\n\n## Ambiguities\n\n- `inferable` — the evidence-kind list is closed and printed on refusal (`aep artifact evidence --help`), so the new kind must be declared where the others are.\n\n## Open Questions\n\nNone.\n","owner":"protocol","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:review-facts"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"A review_outcome evidence record referencing the review-result, refused when the review does not review the artifact.","tags":["evidence","review"],"title":"A review-result records what happened to it: no-op, fixed or escalated"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG84c07c69d53ebc57a436e3a7632fa3a43f53088e12d3fe1233fc9ef39087aa19","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":4,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG84c07c69d53ebc57a436e3a7632fa3a43f53088e12d3fe1233fc9ef39087aa19"]}]